

What is AIOps (AI for IT Operations)

AIOps combines AI + ML + Automation to enhance and
automate traditional IT Operations such as:

Monitoring

Incident Detection & Root Cause Analysis

Capacity Planning

Performance Optimization

Automated Remediation

It ingests logs, metrics, traces, and events from multiple tools (Prometheus, Stackdriver, Azure Monitor, ELK, etc.),
applies machine learning to detect patterns or anomalies, and uses LLMs (like Gemini or GPT-4) to explain insights or trigger automated workflows.

AIOps =

Data + AI + Automation

Layer	Function
Data Layer	Collect logs, metrics, traces (Prometheus, Cloud Logging, Datadog, etc.)
AI/ML Layer	Detect anomalies, predict failures, classify incidents
Automation Layer	Trigger alerts, run remediation scripts, create tickets, or scale infra

